decision readout for https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B

one forward pass, softmax over the answer-letter logits, a
probability per option. no token sampled, no json parsed.
port of https://github.com/TheoLeeCJ/openjev from 4B to 27B.

quick demo:

    $ ./run.sh uv run example.py
